# Cloudflare Turnstile — public site key for the comment form's spam check.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill it in. The comment form is hidden until
# it is set. Also set it as a build variable on the Cloudflare Worker.
#
# Dashboard → Turnstile → Add widget, hostname angleofpursuit.com. Copy the
# Site Key here; the Secret Key goes in the Worker as the TURNSTILE_SECRET
# secret (never in this file — it ships to the browser).
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=

# --- Worker secrets (set with `wrangler secret put NAME`, not here) ---------
# TURNSTILE_SECRET   Turnstile secret key (pairs with the site key above)
# MODERATION_USER    Basic-auth username for /moderate
# MODERATION_PASS    Basic-auth password for /moderate
# IP_SALT            random string; salts stored IP hashes
